    "summary": "One time per battle, once an enemy unit has finished a Normal move, Advance move or Fall Back move no more than 8″ away, this model may set off its Reductus mine: roll a D6, and if it shows 2+ the enemy unit takes D3+3 mortal wounds. In any single battle round, no more than one of your models with this ability may use it. Designer's note: mark this with a Reductus Mine token beside the model and take the token away once the ability is used.",
